{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":15809,\"tags\":[],\"year\":2013,\"idMal\":15809,\"staff\":[{\"id\":78297,\"name\":\"Naoto Hosoda\",\"role\":\"Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":78298,\"name\":\"Jin Aketagawa\",\"role\":\"Sound Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":78299,\"name\":\"Hiroyuki Hashimoto\",\"role\":\"Episode Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":78300,\"name\":\"Tomoki Kobayashi\",\"role\":\"Episode Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":78301,\"name\":\"Kazuomi Koga\",\"role\":\"Episode Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":78302,\"name\":\"Touko Machida\",\"role\":\"Script\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":78303,\"name\":\"Jamie Marchi\",\"role\":\"Script\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":78304,\"name\":\"Kento Shimoyama\",\"role\":\"Script\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":78305,\"name\":\"Masahiro Yokotani\",\"role\":\"Script\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":78306,\"name\":\"Minami Kuribayashi\",\"role\":\"Theme Song Performance\",\"image\":null}],\"title\":\"The Devil is a Part-Timer!\",\"format\":\"TV\",\"genres\":[],\"poster\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/series/267441/posters/60ba84870b6d5.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"season\":\"\",\"status\":\"FINISHED\",\"titles\":{\"de\":\"The Devil Is a Part-Timer!\",\"en\":\"The Devil Is a Part-Timer!\",\"fa\":\"!پادشاه دیوها، کارگر نیمه وقته\",\"fr\":\"McDo\",\"ja\":\"はたらく魔王さま!\",\"ru\":\"Сатана на подработке\",\"th\":\"ผู้กล้าซึนซ่าส์กับจอมมารสู้ชีวิต\",\"x-jat\":\"Hataraku Maou-sama!\",\"zh-Hans\":\"打工吧！魔王大人\",\"zh-Hant\":\"打工吧！魔王大人\"},\"studios\":[],\"trailer\":{\"id\":\"oBdsF4qDBP4\",\"site\":\"YouTube\"},\"backdrop\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/graphical/267441-g.jpg\",\"duration\":24,\"episodes\":13,\"overview\":\"Striking fear into the hearts of mortals, the Demon Lord Satan begins to conquer the land of Ente Isla with his vast demon armies. However, while embarking on this brutal quest to take over the continent, his efforts are foiled by the hero Emilia, forcing Satan to make his swift retreat through a dimensional portal only to land in the human world. Along with his loyal general Alsiel, the demon finds himself stranded in modern-day Tokyo and vows to return and complete his subjugation of Ente Isla—that is, if they can find a way back!\\n\\nPowerless in a world without magic, Satan assumes the guise of a human named Sadao Maou and begins working at MgRonald's—a local fast-food restaurant—to make ends meet. He soon realizes that his goal of conquering Ente Isla is just not enough as he grows determined to climb the corporate ladder and become the ruler of Earth, one satisfied customer at a time!\\n\\nWhether it's part-time work, household chores, or simply trying to pay the rent on time, Hataraku Maou-sama! presents a hilarious view of the most mundane aspects of everyday life, all through the eyes of a hapless demon lord.\\n\\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)\",\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"oBdsF4qDBP4\",\"name\":\"Trailer\"}],\"relations\":[],\"characters\":[{\"name\":\"Sadao Maou\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/38270/image/tiny-6bbaeb0fb22883ba2f34dbcfc0ba5831.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Ryota Osaka\"},{\"name\":\"Chiho Sasaki\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/38273/image/tiny-9e50e7626a6af92a27076e4b6d40ce2d.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Nao Touyama\"},{\"name\":\"Emi Yusa\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/38271/image/tiny-4605d482f10ae197a8df9e9416dc9e35.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Yoko Hikasa\"},{\"name\":\"Tamura\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/39695/image/tiny-8fb32b5073913a7a9db0d17a44ec8789.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Hironori Saitou\"},{\"name\":\"Albert Ende\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/39678/image/tiny-5e7985a8ae18dd19e40a7a3dfd2baf41.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Hiroki Yasumoto\"},{\"name\":\"Emeralda Etuva\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/39679/image/tiny-98175e8d7abde97